<panel>
  <style>
    #root {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 16;
      gap: 8;
      background-color: rgba(10, 26, 10, 0.95);
      border-radius: 16;
      border-color: #88ccaa;
      border-width: 2;
    }
    #tutorial-title {
      font-size: 22;
      color: #88ccaa;
    }
    .section {
      font-size: 14;
      color: #ffaa00;
      margin-top: 6;
    }
    .control-row {
      font-size: 12;
      color: #00ff88;
    }
    .close-btn {
      font-size: 14;
      color: #ff4444;
      background-color: rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.1);
      padding: 6;
      border-radius: 6;
      border-color: #ff4444;
      border-width: 1;
      margin-top: 10;
      min-width: 80;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  </style>
  <div id="root">
    <div id="tutorial-title">CONTROLS</div>
    <div class="section">-- KEYBOARD --</div>
    <div class="control-row">WASD / Arrows: Move</div>
    <div class="control-row">Space / K: Shoot</div>
    <div class="control-row">E / J: Throw Grenade</div>
    <div class="control-row">G: Smoke Grenade</div>
    <div class="control-row">H: Deploy Decoy</div>
    <div class="control-row">R: Call Air Support</div>
    <div class="control-row">C: Deploy Medkit</div>
    <div class="control-row">F: Mount/Dismount Turret</div>
    <div class="control-row">Tab: Cycle Weapon</div>
    <div class="control-row">Shift: Dodge Roll</div>
    <div class="control-row">N: Night Vision</div>
    <div class="control-row">V: Deploy Drone</div>
    <div class="control-row">T: Launch Flare</div>
    <div class="control-row">B: Place Sandbag</div>
    <div class="control-row">Numpad: Aim Direction</div>
    <div class="control-row">Esc / P: Pause</div>
    <div class="section">-- VR CONTROLLERS --</div>
    <div class="control-row">Left Stick: Move</div>
    <div class="control-row">Right Stick: Aim</div>
    <div class="control-row">Right Trigger: Shoot</div>
    <div class="control-row">A Button: Grenade</div>
    <div class="control-row">Left Trigger: Grenade</div>
    <div class="control-row">B Button: Pause</div>
    <div class="section">-- TIPS --</div>
    <div class="control-row">Walk into jeeps to commandeer</div>
    <div class="control-row">F near turrets to mount them</div>
    <div class="control-row">Decoys draw enemy fire</div>
    <div class="control-row">R calls air support (45s cooldown)</div>
    <div class="control-row">Collect dog tags for bonus lives (5 = 1UP)</div>
    <div class="control-row">APCs deploy soldiers when destroyed</div>
    <div class="control-row">Kill officers to remove enemy buffs</div>
    <div class="control-row">Stay near walls/sandbags for cover</div>
    <div class="control-row">Deploy medkits for heal-over-time</div>
    <div class="control-row">Kill radio operators before they call backup!</div>
    <div class="control-row">N: Night vision highlights all enemies</div>
    <div class="control-row">V: Drone scouts reveal enemy positions</div>
    <div class="control-row">T: Flares slow enemies in range</div>
    <div class="control-row">B: Place sandbag walls for bullet cover</div>
    <div class="control-row">Chain kills for combo multiplier</div>
    <div id="btn-close-tutorial" class="close-btn">Close</div>
  </div>
</panel>
